    <decisions>
        <description>Epic &amp;1008 Global Service Case Status field Update
Update Status to Assigned , modified the logic as when the case status is New , the previous case owner is Queue and the current owner is User then the status update to Assign. - #24410
Updated rule for record type &quot;CAC Executive Escalations&quot;. For ref, check user story #27570 on Gitlab</description>
        <name>Global_Service_Case_Status_Update</name>
        <label>Global Service Case Status Update</label>
        <locationX>974</locationX>
        <locationY>287</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Update_Status_to_Assigned</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>New</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Owner:User.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>StartsWith</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>005</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record__Prior.OwnerId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>StartsWith</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>00G</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global Service Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Status_Update_to_Assigned</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
            <label>Update Status to Assigned</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Update_Status_to_In_Progress</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND 2 AND 3 AND 4 AND 5 AND 6 AND 7</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.DeveloperName</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global_Service_Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Customer_ID__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Owner:User.Id</leftValueReference>
                <operator>StartsWith</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>005</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Waiting for Agent</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.GSC_Category__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.GSC_Sub_Category__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global Service Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Status_Update_to_In_Progress</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
            <label>Update Status to In Progress</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Update_Status_to_On_Hold_Customer</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.NAS_Pending_Reason__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Customer Response</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global Service Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Status_Change_to_Customer_On_Hold</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
            <label>Update Status to On-Hold Customer</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Update_Status_to_On_Hold_Internal</name>
            <conditionLogic>(1 OR 2) AND 3</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.NAS_Pending_Reason__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Internal Response</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.NAS_Pending_Reason__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Supervisor</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global Service Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Status_Change_to_On_Hold_Internal</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
            <label>Update Status to On- Hold Internal</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Update_Status_to_Resolved</name>
            <conditionLogic>(1  AND 5 AND 6) OR( 2 AND (3 OR 4) AND 5 AND 6 )</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.GSC_Root_Cause__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Non adherence to process by IM</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.GSC_Root_Cause__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Non adherence to process by IM</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.GSC_Root_Cause_Department__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.GSC_Root_Cause_Owner__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.GSC_Root_Cause__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global Service Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Status_Change_to_Resolved</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>true</doesRequireRecordChangedToMeetCriteria>
            <label>Update Status to Resolved</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Update_Status_to_In_Progress_when_pending_reason_is_removed</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.NAS_Pending_Reason__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.NAS_Pending_Reason__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global Service Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Status_Update_to_In_Progress_when_Pending_Reason_is_removed</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Update Status to In Progress when pending reason is removed</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Cancel_the_Duplicate_Case</name>
            <conditionLogic>1 AND 2 AND (3 OR 4) AND (5 OR 6)</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.NAS_Reparent_Email_Messages__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.ParentId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.NAS_Reparent_Email_Messages__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.ParentId</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsChanged</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Global Service Case</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.RecordType.Name</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>CAC Executive Escalations</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Status_Update_to_Cancelled</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Cancel the Duplicate Case</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>Epic #1008 Global Service Case
Updated (Reparent Email messaging- Cancel the Duplicate case) rule for record type &quot;CAC Executive Escalations&quot;. For ref, check user story #27570 on Gitlab</description>
